<p>
            The $39 figure above is not a guess: it is what iFIT charges for its Pro membership,
            the one that runs on NordicTrack and ProForm touchscreens. The other platforms sit
            either side of it. Every price below was read from the company's own website and
            is labelled with when it was checked; promotions, bundles and regional pricing
            change often, so confirm before you subscribe.
          </p>
